| **Available Resources**       | Source to Resource Edges  | Represents the supply capacity of each resource (e.g., 1 developer, 5 servers). |
| **Tasks/Demands**             | Task to Sink Edges        | Represents the demand of each task (e.g., 1 developer per project).         |
| **Compatibility/Feasibility** | Resource to Task Edges    | Connects compatible resources and tasks, often with capacity 1.             |
